direction: down

source: |md
  **GitHub issue and pull-request surface**

  - Issue text and author-or-writer comments
  - Revision-fresh approval and bounded public media
  - Managed and ordinary PRs plus discussion
|

manager: |md
  **Manager App control plane**

  - Signed intake and canonical double read
  - Writer authority and physical capacity
  - CAS lifecycle, tagged dispatch, audited recovery
|

stores: |md
  **Durable evidence stores**

  - PostgreSQL runs, stages, and outboxes
  - Observations, quotas, and audit digests
  - Addressed snapshots and artifacts
|

controller: |md
  **Private model runner and trusted controllers**

  - Serialized `cloudx-codex` ChatGPT login
  - Workspace-only profiles and shell-free proposal
  - GitHub-hosted credential-free verifier
  - 11 area reviews and non-lossy aggregate
|

publisher: |md
  **Candidate Publisher App**

  - Validate the candidate and open its PR
  - Publish exact `CI / merge-gate` evidence
  - Publish exact `AI Review / head` evidence
|

protection: |md
  **Exact identity and repository protection**

  - Bind v2 base, head, tree, policy, and subject
  - Strict checks and Merge-App update authority
  - Audited immutable tag, environments, and mutex
|

merge: |md
  **Merge Authority App**

  - Managed, writer, or reviewed intent
  - Two readiness reads plus final ref read
  - SHA-bound squash with exact proof
|

outcome: |md
  **Authoritative outcome**

  - Exact tested tree reaches `main`
  - Progress and proof remain in discussion
  - Durable manager audit state remains authoritative
|

source -> manager: "Signed delivery"
manager -> stores: "Single durable state authority"
stores -> controller: "Immutable context and one-time capabilities"
controller -> publisher: "Verified candidate and non-lossy review"
publisher -> protection: "Exact App-origin evidence"
protection -> merge: "Eligible identity only"
merge -> outcome: "Confirmed SHA-bound squash"
outcome -> source: "Discussion projection and base invalidation" {
  style.stroke-dash: 4
}

source.style.fill: "#f4f7fb"
source.style.stroke: "#44546a"
manager.style.fill: "#e8f2ff"
manager.style.stroke: "#245ea8"
stores.style.fill: "#fff4d6"
stores.style.stroke: "#8a5c00"
controller.style.fill: "#f3edff"
controller.style.stroke: "#6941a5"
publisher.style.fill: "#f7f1de"
publisher.style.stroke: "#7a6500"
protection.style.fill: "#e8f7ec"
protection.style.stroke: "#25713a"
merge.style.fill: "#ffeceb"
merge.style.stroke: "#a33a32"
outcome.style.fill: "#f4f7fb"
outcome.style.stroke: "#44546a"
